{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.juri.shop",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她在服屋前转来转去",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.juri.shop",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.juri.shop",
    "idolId": "juri",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（好，回事务所处理文件吧……）",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……嗯？那里的，不是樹里吗？）",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（在服装店前转来转去……在干什么呢。）",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "樹里，怎么了？",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "哇啊！？",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "……是你啊。别突然出声啊！",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "抱、抱歉。没想到你会吓成这样。",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "话说你在看什么？……这件可爱的衣服，那么在意吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "……不是那样。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "既然这样，进去试穿一下不就好了。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "所、所以说，不是那样！",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "我就是……只是路过而已……",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（唔，真不坦率啊。这样的话……）",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "樹里，听我说。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "干、干什么啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "樹里试穿各种衣服、引出各种表情，也能连接到作为偶像的魅力。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "而且引出魅力，也是制作人的职责。所以，你跟我来。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "哇，等一下！等等啊！",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "……真是的，没想到你是这么强硬的男的。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "算了，既然进来了就没办法，我选就是了。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（好，嘴上那样说，其实挺开心的吧。）",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "……哦，还挺多的。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那，什么样的衣服好？……这里的怎么样？",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "那种露肩的，凉飕飕的怎么穿得了！",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "唔，这样啊。……那，那边那件怎么样？没露肩，看起来也适合樹里。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "哈、哈啊！？那种飘飘的衣服！？",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "开玩笑也适可而止吧！",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我觉得不错啊。不喜欢那件的话，下次那边……",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "够、够了！不是那样！",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "那个……我在找的，不是我的衣服！",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶……？",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "……前阵子，果穂说想穿穿看大人一点的衣服。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "所以我在找适合果穂的、可爱但稍微大人一点的衣服。",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "什么啊，原来是这么回事。樹里真为伙伴着想啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "哼。别管我……",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "总之，情况我知道了。一起找果穂的衣服吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "嗯，你肯帮忙就帮大忙了。",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不过樹里也想要什么的话，不用客气说啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "说了不要了！",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "……不过，算了，如果我想穿可爱衣服的话……",
        "nextNodeId": "42"
      },
      "42": {
        "id": "42",
        "speakerId": "juri",
        "text": "我自己也不知道什么可爱衣服适合我，让你来选也行，吧。"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
  "createdAt": "2026-11-02T04:10:00.000Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-11-02T04:10:00.000Z",
